MAM-GRAPH-0004 | /resources/2 (NodeK3s c/k3s) spec.sha256 | NodeK3s has no spec.sha256 | 
MAM-GRAPH-0004 | /resources/2 (NodeK3s c/k3s) spec.version | NodeK3s has no spec.version | 
MAM-GRAPH-0004 | /resources/3 (NodeK3sManifest e/manifest/x) spec.content | NodeK3sManifest has no spec.content | 
MAM-GRAPH-0004 | /resources/3 (NodeK3sManifest e/manifest/x) spec.name | NodeK3sManifest has no spec.name | 
MAM-GRAPH-0005 | /resources/4/kind | NodeK3s is a built-in kind; a provider cannot declare it | 
MAM-GRAPH-0005 | /resources/5/kind | the built-in kind VirtualMachine was removed: machines come from providers (ADR 0006) | declare the machine with its provider's Pome (for Proxmox, github.com/ieyoukan/mamela-proxmox/pome: Proxmox.vm) and use the Mamela Pome 0.3.0
MAM-GRAPH-0005 | /resources/6/kind | kind "Unknown" is not known | known kinds are NodePackage, NodeService, NodeK3s, NodeK3sManifest and NodeMamelet; a provider's kind needs its "provider"
